  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm no different than any other player whose been enjoying this game for years on end. But the problem is you know EAC isn't going to change any of the problems you have, it's going to cause an outrage among half of the people who even play or keep the game alive and financially support it by buying VRChat plus. I know well over a few hundred of people who'll stop playing as of right now just from the huge community of friends and sometimes even people I consider as family that I've gathered in Vrchat. These modifications do a better job of protecting us than EAC so please just let them keep doing their work. I understand wanting provide security but if you were doing right nobody would be upset about it would they? You wouldn't have hundreds of people coming in to say \"Don't do this\" if you were fixing everything.",
